OL,3,GNEWSAFormer BBC journalist Stephen
OL,4,AWalker dies, aged 61
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe award-winning journalist and author
OL,7,FStephen Walker has died at the age of
OL,8,F61.
OL,10,FThe former BBC Northern Ireland
OL,11,Fpolitical correspondent wrote five
OL,12,Fbooks including biographies of two of
OL,13,Fthe key players in the Northern Ireland
OL,14,Fpeace process John Hume and David
OL,15,FTrimble.
OL,17,FDuring a high-profile career at the BBC
OL,18,Ffor three decades, he was an
OL,19,Finvestigative reporter on the Spotlight
OL,20,Fprogramme as well as being both London
OL,21,Fcorrespondent and political
OL,22,Fcorrespondent.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
